---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="IT &amp; Tech Parks — Fusionedge">
<div class="ix">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-hero">
    <span class="ix-kick">Facility software for IT and tech parks</span>
    <h1><span>Every tower, tenant and visitor,</span><span class="ix-c">on one platform.</span></h1>
    <p class="ix-lead">Tech parks run like small cities. FusionEdge brings visitors, desks, maintenance, energy and tenant requests into one live view of the whole campus.</p>
    <div class="ix-btns">
      <a class="ix-btn pri" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a demo</a>
      <a class="ix-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to our team</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-trust"><span><b>All 26 apps</b> in one plan</span><span>Built for multi-tower campuses</span><span>No card needed</span></div>
    <div class="ix-stage">
      <div class="ix-app" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a FusionEdge IT &amp; Tech Parks dashboard">
        <div class="ix-chrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="u">app.fusionedge.io/tickets</span></div>
        <div class="ix-scroll"><div class="ix-ui">
          <div class="ix-side"><span class="">Overview</span><span class="on">Tickets</span><span class="">Tenants</span><span class="">Visitors</span><span class="">Energy</span><span class="">Reports</span></div>
          <div class="db"><div class="db-h"><div><b>Tenant service desk</b><small>Tech Park · 4 towers · 62 tenants</small></div><div class="sp"><span class="db-pill">All towers ▾</span><span class="db-pill">Today</span><span class="db-btn">New ticket</span></div></div><div class="db-k"><div><small>Open tickets</small><strong>40</strong><em class="">▼ 6 since 9 am</em></div><div><small>SLA met</small><strong>97.6%</strong><em class="">▲ 0.8%</em></div><div><small>Avg. response</small><strong>11 min</strong><em class="">target 15 min</em></div><div><small>Escalated</small><strong>2</strong><em class="r">both Tower B</em></div></div><div class="db-row" style="grid-template-columns:.8fr 1fr 1.7fr"><div class="db-pn"><div class="db-pt"><b>SLA status</b><span>Today</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" style="width:110px;margin:0 auto"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="36" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="12" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="78 22" stroke-dashoffset="25"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="36" fill="none" stroke="#00BF88" stroke-width="12" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="14 86" stroke-dashoffset="-53"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="36" fill="none" stroke="#e8a23a" stroke-width="12" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="8 92" stroke-dashoffset="-67"/><text x="50" y="49" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1424">97.6%</text><text x="50" y="61" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#6b6478">SLA met</text></svg><div class="db-leg"><span><i style="background:#5D1F72"></i>Met</span><span><i style="background:#00BF88"></i>In time</span><span><i style="background:#e8a23a"></i>At risk</span></div></div><div class="db-pn"><div class="db-pt"><b>Open by tower</b></div><div class="db-tb"><div style="grid-template-columns:.8fr 2fr .3fr"><span>Tower</span><span>Open tickets</span><span></span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.8fr 2fr .3fr"><b>Tower A</b><div class="db-bar"><i class="" style="width:54%"></i></div><span>9</span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.8fr 2fr .3fr"><b>Tower B</b><div class="db-bar"><i class="" style="width:84%"></i></div><span>14</span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.8fr 2fr .3fr"><b>Tower C</b><div class="db-bar"><i class="" style="width:36%"></i></div><span>6</span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.8fr 2fr .3fr"><b>Tower D</b><div class="db-bar"><i class="" style="width:66%"></i></div><span>11</span></div></div></div><div class="db-pn"><div class="db-pt"><b>Live tickets</b><span>Newest first</span></div><div class="db-tb"><div style="grid-template-columns:.5fr 1.6fr 1fr .9fr"><span>Ticket</span><span>Issue</span><span>Location</span><span>SLA</span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.5fr 1.6fr 1fr .9fr"><span>#4821</span><b>AHU-3 temperature high</b><span>Tower A · L6</span><i class="db-st w">12 min left</i></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.5fr 1.6fr 1fr .9fr"><span>#4822</span><b>Lift L4 stuck at L9</b><span>Tower B</span><i class="db-st r">Escalated</i></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.5fr 1.6fr 1fr .9fr"><span>#4819</span><b>Washroom supplies</b><span>Tower C · L2</span><i class="db-st g">On track</i></div><div style="grid-template-columns:.5fr 1.6fr 1fr .9fr"><span>#4817</span><b>Desk power socket</b><span>Tower D · L11</span><i class="db-st p">Closed</i></div></div></div></div></div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ix-re"><div><b>All 26 apps in one plan</b><p>From asset management to visitor management, with no hidden add-ons.</p></div><div><b>No card, no setup fee</b><p>Book a demo and see it working on your own sites and assets.</p></div><div><b>ISO 27001:2022 certified</b><p>AES-256 encryption, two-factor login and role-based access.</p></div><div><b>Web, mobile and QR</b><p>Technicians work on their phones. Anyone can report an issue by QR.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <hr class="ix-rule">

  <!-- Segments -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-sec">
    <div class="ix-head">
      <div><h2>Which kind of campus is yours?</h2><p class="ix-p">A single tower and a city-sized SEZ break in different places. FusionEdge fits the way each one runs.</p></div>
      <a class="ix-link" href="/industries/">All industries →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-segs"><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="High-rise office buildings" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>IT parks and SEZs</h3><p>Many towers, many tenants</p><small><b>Fits</b> · SLAs and tenant billing</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448721149-aa0ce8e1b2c9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448721149-aa0ce8e1b2c9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448721149-aa0ce8e1b2c9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Modern office lobby with elevators and reception" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Office towers</h3><p>One building, many floors</p><small><b>Fits</b> · lifts, HVAC, visitors</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527192491265-7e15c55b1ed2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527192491265-7e15c55b1ed2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527192491265-7e15c55b1ed2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="People working at monitors in a co-working space" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Co-working spaces</h3><p>Flexible desks and rooms</p><small><b>Fits</b> · standard SOPs everywhere</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584169417032-d34e8d805e8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584169417032-d34e8d805e8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584169417032-d34e8d805e8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Server room aisle with equipment racks" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Data and tech campuses</h3><p>Critical infrastructure</p><small><b>Fits</b> · readings and uptime</small></article></div>

    <!-- Feature photo -->
    <div class="ix-feat">
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-4b46a572b786?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-4b46a572b786?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-4b46a572b786?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2800&q=60 2x" alt="Man working at a desk with several monitors" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div class="ix-feat-card"><h2>Tenants judge you on SLAs</h2><p class="ix-p">Every request is timed, assigned and escalated automatically, so tenants get answers before they have to chase.</p><a class="ix-link" href="/industries/it-tech-parks#faq-0">See smart ticketing →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it runs -->
  <section class="ix-runs">
    <div class="ix-w ix-runs-g">
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448721205-8465cebc26af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448721205-8465cebc26af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758448721205-8465cebc26af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=60 2x" alt="Modern lobby with reception desk and elevators" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div>
        <h2>How a campus day runs</h2>
        <p class="ix-p">The same five jobs every day, now in one place and in the order they happen.</p>
        <div class="ix-rows"><div class="ix-row"><b>08:30</b><p>Employees badge in, and pre-registered visitors check in with a QR code.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>10:00</b><p>An AC fault becomes a ticket with the asset’s history, and the SLA timer starts.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>13:00</b><p>Cafeteria orders come in by QR, and pantry stock is tracked live.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>18:00</b><p>Meters are read at a fixed time, and energy spikes are flagged.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>21:00</b><p>After-hours power use is measured and billed to the right tenant.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ix-btns"><a class="ix-btn dark" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">See the platform</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Side by side -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-sec ix-sbs">
    <div>
      <h2>Two weeks, side by side</h2>
      <p class="ix-p">Same campus, same towers, same tenants. The difference is who hears about problems first.</p>
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531973576160-7125cd663d86?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531973576160-7125cd663d86?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531973576160-7125cd663d86?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="People collaborating in an open office" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-tbl"><div class="th"></div><div class="th">A week on spreadsheets</div><div class="th hi">A week with FusionEdge</div><div class="d">Monday</div><div class="o">Visitors queue at reception while passes are written by hand.</div><div class="n">Visitors were pre-registered and check in with a QR code.</div><div class="d">Tuesday</div><div class="o">A tenant emails about a hot floor. Nobody logs it.</div><div class="n">The request opens a ticket, and the SLA timer starts.</div><div class="d">Wednesday</div><div class="o">The same AC fails again. Its history is unknown.</div><div class="n">The AHU’s full history is on the ticket.</div><div class="d">Thursday</div><div class="o">Lift checks are done, but the record is on paper.</div><div class="n">Checks are logged with photos and time stamps.</div><div class="d">Friday</div><div class="o">After-hours power is not measured, so the park pays.</div><div class="n">The 9 pm reading is billed to the right tenant.</div><div class="d">Saturday</div><div class="o">The DG load test is missed.</div><div class="n">The test was scheduled and assigned to the vendor.</div><div class="d">Sunday</div><div class="o">The park head learns about issues from tenant complaints.</div><div class="n">One dashboard shows every tower and every SLA.</div></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Customer story -->
  <section class="ix-story">
    <div class="ix-w">
      <h2>14 campuses, one way of working</h2>
      <p class="ix-p">How a fast-growing co-working operator put every campus on the same processes in 10 weeks.</p>
      <div class="ix-card">
        <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772723822651-d2161754d61b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772723822651-d2161754d61b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772723822651-d2161754d61b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=60 2x" alt="Co-working space interior with sofa and plants" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
        <div class="ix-cb">
          <span class="who">Facility Operations, Readings &amp; Logs, PPM</span>
          <p class="sum">A fast-growing co-working operator had no clear view of what was happening across its campuses. FusionEdge gave every campus the same processes and tracked 32,000+ assets.</p>
          <div class="ix-stats"><div><b>96%</b><span>PPM done on time, up from 52%</span></div><div><b>−45%</b><span>unplanned breakdowns</span></div><div><b>5 days</b><span>to set up a new campus, down from 3 weeks</span></div></div>
          <blockquote>“Every task is closed with a photo and time stamp, so service quality can be proven to tenants.”</blockquote>
          <div class="ix-btns"><a class="ix-btn dark" href="/stories/facility-operations">Read the story</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ix-also"><b>Also running on FusionEdge:</b><div><span>IT and ITES parks</span><span>SEZs</span><span>Office towers</span><span>Co-working operators</span><span>Global capability centres</span><span>Business parks</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ix-cta">
    <div class="ix-w">
      <h2>Run your campus <span>on FusionEdge.</span></h2>
      <p class="ix-p">Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your towers, tenants and visitors. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="ix-btns">
        <a class="ix-btn pri" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="ix-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.ix{--brand:#5D1F72;--ink:#1a1424;--mut:#6b6478;--line:rgba(93,31,114,0.1);--soft:rgba(93,31,114,0.05);--soft2:#f5f5f7;--mint:#eef8f3;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#008a62;
  --w:1080px;--pad:clamp(20px,4vw,40px);--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);
  font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;background:#fff;overflow-x:clip}
.ix *,.ix *::before,.ix *::after{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif}
.ix h1,.ix h2,.ix h3,.ix p{margin:0;max-width:none}
.ix a{color:inherit}
.ix-w{max-width:calc(var(--w) + var(--pad)*2);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad)}
.ix h1{font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,58px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.ix h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);text-wrap:balance}
.ix h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}
.ix .ix-c{color:var(--brand)}
.ix .ix-p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.ix-kick{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);letter-spacing:.01em}
.ix-btns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.ix a.ix-btn,.ix a.ix-btn:visited{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:99px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none!important;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.18);background:#fff;color:var(--ink)!important;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s,background .15s}
.ix a.ix-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.ix a.ix-btn.pri,.ix a.ix-btn.pri:visited{background:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);color:#fff!important}
.ix a.ix-btn.pri:hover{background:var(--brand-d)}
.ix a.ix-btn.dark,.ix a.ix-btn.dark:visited{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff!important}
.ix a.ix-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)!important;text-decoration:none}
.ix a.ix-link:hover{color:var(--brand)!important}
.ix-ph{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px;color:#8d83a0;font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(93,31,114,0.1),#e6f4ee)}
.ix-ph span{max-width:26ch;line-height:1.4;opacity:.85}
.ix-ph img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

/* Hero */
.ix-hero{text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,88px)}
.ix-hero h1{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:none}
.ix-hero h1 span{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.ix-hero .ix-lead{max-width:540px;margin:20px auto 28px;font-size:16px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.6}
.ix-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:6px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-trust b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.ix-trust span+span::before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.25);margin:0 14px 2px 0;vertical-align:middle}
.ix-stage{position:relative;margin-top:clamp(36px,5vw,52px)}
.ix-stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-50vw;right:-50vw;top:12%;bottom:0;background:var(--soft);z-index:0}

/* App mock */
.ix-app{position:relative;z-index:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.12);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -24px rgba(93,31,114,.25);overflow:hidden;text-align:left}
.ix-chrome{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:34px;padding:0 12px;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.03);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.1)}
.ix-chrome i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.18);display:inline-block}
.ix-chrome .u{margin:0 auto;font-size:10.5px;color:#8d83a0;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.1);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 14px}
.ix-scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.ix-ui{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);min-width:900px;font-size:11px}
.ix-side{border-right:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.07);padding:14px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.ix-side span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:7px;color:#4b4357}
.ix-side span.on{background:var(--soft);color:var(--brand);font-weight:600}
.ix-side em{font-style:normal;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#e5483b;border-radius:99px;padding:0 6px}
.ix-main{padding:12px 14px 6px}
.ix-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ix-top b{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)}
.ix-top small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-tog{display:flex;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.06);border-radius:7px;padding:2px;margin-left:6px}
.ix-tog span{padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;font-size:10px}
.ix-tog span.on{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.ix-prog{margin-left:auto;text-align:right;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-prog b{display:inline;font-size:11px}
.ix-prog em{display:block;width:150px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.09);margin-top:4px;overflow:hidden}
.ix-prog em i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--green);border-radius:99px}
.ix-pub{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:10.5px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap}
.ix-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));border-top:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.07)}
.ix-grid>div{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.06);border-left:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.06);min-height:46px;padding:5px}
.ix-grid>div:nth-child(8n+1){border-left:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-left:2px}
.ix-gh{min-height:28px!important;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center}
.ix-gh.today{color:var(--brand)}
.ix-av{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.08);color:var(--brand)}
.ix-av.op{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed rgba(93,31,114,0.4);color:var(--brand)}
.ix-rn b{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}
.ix-rn small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-ch{display:block;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 6px;line-height:1.25;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600}
.ix-ch small{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:8.5px;opacity:.8}
.ix-ch.ppm{background:rgba(93,31,114,0.08);color:#5D1F72}
.ix-ch.chk{background:#e8f8f1;color:#00754f}
.ix-ch.tkt{background:#fdecea;color:#b23a2b}
.ix-ch.ins{background:#fdf1e2;color:#9a5c0d}
.ix-ch.opn{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed rgba(93,31,114,0.35);color:#5D1F72}
